Note that this FAQ does not say "WHY" you should re-compile or=20
otherwise fix the problem if you get "LOTS" of these messages...

It DOES impact performance!

Basically, the more errors being generated, the more CPU time is spent=20=

correcting and logging the errors.

How many is a lot?

Look at the log files. If they are getting huge fast, then you've=20
definitely got a problem that needs to be fixed -- ASAP.

If you only get a few when the program loads, then you can just ignore=20=

them.



